WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.768
-Like I said, one of our guests
tonight is Colin Quinn,

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:03.937
the great Colin Quinn,

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:05.571
and he has a book out
called "Overstated"

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:07.974
where he basically roasts
every state in the U.S.

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:10.643
It's funny, and you can
just read it in any order.

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:11.677
It's a good book.

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:13.479
Well, I wanted to put him
to the test,

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:16.616
so now it's time for
"Overstated with Colin Quinn."

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:18.017
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:22.588
-♪ Overstated, overstated,
overstated, overstated ♪

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:23.656
♪ Yeah ♪

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.625
-Colin, Colin, are you there?

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.327
Oh, I see you.
-Oh, yes.

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:28.995
-Wow, yeah.

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:31.798
Colin, I thought we could
go through some states

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.366
and you can give them
a quick roasting.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.902
Does that sound okay?
-Sure.

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:37.236
-First of all,
how are you doing?

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:38.605
Are you okay?

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:39.839
-Oh, I don't know
why you would --

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:41.007
You should have
said that before...

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:43.176
-I know, I know, I know, I know.
I understand.

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:45.845
I know, but I --
I admit -- Sorry.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.313
-Hey, you just started this.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.749
-I know, but it wasn't
on the teleprompter.

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:51.450
But, yeah, you look good.
I hope you're okay.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:55.120
-Oh, it wasn't on
the teleprompter.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.522
-It's not about
being a big shot.

00:00:56.522 --> 00:00:58.758
That's the way it works.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.059
Acting like I'm trying to --

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:01.628
-No, I wasn't
calling you a big shot.

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:04.196
I was saying -- I was making
a dumb joke that,

00:01:04.196 --> 00:01:06.466
"It wasn't on the teleprompter.
I couldn't read it."

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:09.034
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.034 --> 00:01:12.638
Sorry.
-Oh, my God.

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:16.075
I guess we started with
the first roast already.

00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:17.810
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:20.680
How about this, Colin?
Arizona.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.315 line:0%
What could you say
about Arizona?

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:24.016 line:0%
-I call them the Instagram state

00:01:24.016 --> 00:01:25.752 line:0%
'cause they're beautiful
but empty.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.921 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.956 line:0%
[ Applause ]

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:34.961 line:0%
-How about -- How about Ohio?

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:36.895 line:0%
-Ohio's like the middle,
like the nice --

00:01:36.895 --> 00:01:39.531 line:0%
They're like your nice friend
that waits in the car

00:01:39.531 --> 00:01:41.300 line:0%
while you're hooking up
with somebody in the house.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:43.336 line:0%
They'll sit there and wait
to drive you home.

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:45.438 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:50.276 line:0%
-Florida.

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:53.512 line:0%
-Florida's the hot mess
that you want to hang out with

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:55.348 line:0%
but you always end up
getting arrested with them.

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:57.550 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:02.288 line:0%
-Okay, last state.
Pennsylvania.

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.622 line:0%
-I don't want to do Pennsylvania

00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:05.725 line:0%
'cause you're gonna feel like
it's an attack on you,

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:07.126 line:0%
but it's not.

00:02:07.126 --> 00:02:08.861 line:0%
-Why?

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:11.497 line:0%
-Alright, I'll do it.
But don't be paranoid, okay?

00:02:11.497 --> 00:02:15.735 line:0%
My joke is, it's a state
that kind of, like, started,

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:18.471 line:0%
it almost fell apart,
then it came back strong.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:21.573 line:0%
You might call it like
the "Fever Pitch" of states,

00:02:21.573 --> 00:02:23.743 line:0%
I call it.
That's the nickname.

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:25.712 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:28.280 line:0%
I didn't make up that nickname.
That's the state nickname.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.582
It's on the license plate.

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:30.683
-Why would I even do this?

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:32.818
How do I not
take that personally?

00:02:32.885 --> 00:02:35.821
How do I not
take that personally?

00:02:35.888 --> 00:02:38.524
How do I not
take that personally?

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:41.261
Give it up for Colin Quinn,
everybody.

